448		\[
449			\big(T^{\ell_X,\ell_Z}
450			_{[\mathrm{eval}_x(\cdot)=a,\ \mathrm{eval}_z(\cdot)=b]}
451			\big)_{\mathsf{A}\mathsf{A}'}
452			\simeq_{\delta_P}
453			\big(\hat{Q}^{x,z}_{a,b}\big)_{\mathsf{B}\mathsf{A}''}\,,
454		\]
455		as well as all symmetric equivalents of this approximation. Moreover, if
456		$\ell_W$ is axis-parallel, then $f_W \in \deg_{d}(\ell_W)$.
