516	\section{Applying the classical low-degree test}
517	\label{sec:apply-ldt}
518	
519	The combined point and line measurements of the previous two sections are next
520	merged into a single measurement returning a pair of global polynomials that
521	encode the $X$-basis and the $Z$-basis information simultaneously. This is
